cue-w5h81j1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.500
[distant city hum]

cue-r8bubm2
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.500
[footsteps, a shutter rattles]

cue-hmvr9o3
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.000
Third lantern, then left...
it has to be here.

cue-z2x0in4
00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.700
Narrow. Of course it's narrow.

cue-7bpt485
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.700
Maya? Maya! Over here!

cue-lg89226
00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:05.200
Nico! I almost walked
right past you.

cue-ptmmjc7
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.300
Two years, and you still pick
the hardest street in Tokyo to find.

cue-870z2w8
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.900
Hardest to find,
easiest to love.

cue-mn8zi39
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.900
Don't start.
Still awful coffee?

cue-hwi4jta
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.900
Awful. That's why
it's perfect.

cue-qeltlvb
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.900
Fine. Make mine
the strong one.

cue-ffwoz5c
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.600
Already done. Sit, sit!

cue-j5m69cd
00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:29.900
So tell me everything.
What happened to the studio?
You just... vanished.

cue-a3oem2e
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.500
[a cup clinks on its saucer]

cue-lz4nw0f
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:43.700
The lease ended. Everyone said quit.
So I bought a coffee machine.

cue-i96tr8g
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:52.200
A coffee machine. Of course you did.
And people cross the whole city for it?

cue-if9nnph
00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.600
[a bell, far off]

cue-cti5ubi
00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.300
Only the lost ones.

cue-3zbhtej
00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:02.600
Then I'm in the right place.

cue-09eb0nk
00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:05.500
You always were.

cue-9lnecil
00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:16.800
[both laughing]

cue-cq0gbqm
00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:20.900
Same time next week?

cue-kyy6nvn
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.500
I'll keep the strong one warm.

cue-epsov6o
00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:31.500
[soft music swells]
